home=hero('IT SERVICES · SOFTWARE · AI AUTOMATION','Your IT team.<br><em>One hello away.</em>','From engineer dispatch to business software and AI automation. HeyDock connects the people and technology you need to move forward.','Find your solution','/contact.html',visual)
