page('services.html','Our services','Explore HeyDock IT support, staffing, software and AI services.',hero('OUR SERVICES','Technology support.<br><em>From end to end.</em>','Six connected capabilities. One clear starting point for your next support requirement, project or technical hire.')+section('CHOOSE YOUR STARTING POINT','What can we help you deliver?','',cards(services))+section('ENGAGEMENT OPTIONS','Work with us your way.','The right commercial model depends on the work—not a one-size-fits-all subscription.',steps([('On demand','Scoped engineer visits and support tasks.'),('Project delivery','Defined outcomes with agreed milestones.'),('Dedicated resource','Technical capacity for agreed hours and skills.'),('Ongoing support','Recurring coverage within a defined service schedule.')])), '/services.html')
data={
'it-support':('IT SUPPORT','Support that keeps<br><em>work moving.</em>','Practical on-site and remote support for desktops, users and everyday business technology.',['Desktop and laptop troubleshooting|Diagnose device, application and peripheral problems within the agreed environment.','Remote user assistance|Support approved users through authorised remote access and clear escalation.','Device setup and onboarding|Prepare equipment, install agreed applications and document handover.','Office changes and rollouts|Coordinate desk moves, refreshes, training rooms and deployment activities.'],['Your users, locations and supported systems','Business hours and escalation contacts','Remote access and security requirements','Response targets and on-site arrangements'], [('Do you offer one-off support?','Yes. Individual tasks can be scoped alongside project and ongoing support arrangements.'),('Is support available around the clock?','Service hours are agreed for each contract. Extended-hours requirements depend on confirmed staffing and coverage.'),('Can you support our existing IT team?','Yes. We can provide additional hands, local attendance and scoped remote support.')]),
'engineer-dispatch':('ENGINEER DISPATCH','The right engineer.<br><em>Where work happens.</em>','On-site engineering for IT providers and businesses across confirmed UK and European locations.',['Planned site visits|Book attendance for a defined work order with skills and site access agreed in advance.','Network smart hands|Provide physical assistance under your network team’s authorised instructions.','Multi-site rollouts|Coordinate device deployments, refresh projects and repeatable site tasks.','Surveys and documentation|Capture agreed site information, asset records and completion evidence.'],['Site address and access window','Task list, tools, parts and skill requirements','Remote escalation owner and change approval','Attendance target, travel costs and reporting'], [('Can engineers represent our brand?','White-label delivery is available by agreement, including customer communications and reporting expectations.'),('Do you guarantee four-hour arrival everywhere?','No universal attendance time is advertised. We confirm the specific location, availability and service commitment before booking.'),('What happens if the task cannot be completed?','The engineer records findings and escalates to the agreed contact. Additional work or visits follow the approved change process.')]),
'remote-talent':('REMOTE TECHNICAL TALENT','Add expertise.<br><em>Keep your momentum.</em>','Extend your capacity with remote IT engineers, software specialists and customer support resources.',['IT and service desk engineers|Scope the technical level, platforms, hours and escalation responsibilities.','Software and QA specialists|Add development, testing and integration capacity matched to your stack.','AI and automation specialists|Bring defined workflow, integration and model-evaluation skills into a project.','Chat and customer support|Set up support coverage with agreed channels, knowledge, quality and escalation.'],['Role, verified skills and technology stack','Working hours, language and time zone','Client supervision or managed delivery model','Secure access, equipment and onboarding'], [('Can we review a specialist before starting?','The selection process can include a skills review and interview appropriate to the assignment.'),('Who manages day-to-day work?','For staffing, the customer normally directs the assignment. For managed delivery, HeyDock owns the agreed delivery process. We define this before starting.'),('Are all roles immediately available?','Availability is confirmed against the role and start date. We do not promise every skill is available at all times.')]),
'custom-software':('CUSTOM SOFTWARE & WEBSITES','Built around your business.<br><em>Not the other way round.</em>','Custom applications, websites and integrations designed around the way your team works.',['Business applications|Scope internal tools, customer portals and operational systems around actual user needs.','Professional websites|Create responsive company websites, service pages and structured enquiry journeys.','System integrations|Connect approved systems through documented interfaces and tested data flows.','Modernisation and maintenance|Assess existing software, prioritise improvements and agree ongoing ownership.'],['Business goals and user journeys','Features, integrations and data migration','Hosting, source access and IP arrangements','Acceptance tests, training and maintenance'], [('Should we buy software or build it?','Discovery compares your needs with existing options. A configured product may suit standard workflows; bespoke development can address a specific gap.'),('Will we receive the source code?','Source access, ownership, pre-existing components and third-party licences are agreed in the contract.'),('How is pricing decided?','Clear requirements can support a scoped project price. Uncertain requirements should begin with discovery and a defined deliverable.')]),
'ai-automation':('AI AUTOMATION & CHATBOTS','Less repetitive work.<br><em>More useful intelligence.</em>','Practical AI assistants and connected workflows, designed around measurable business tasks.',['Customer support chatbots|Assist with approved knowledge, draft answers and route conversations to people when needed.','Knowledge assistants|Help teams find relevant information in authorised sources with access controls.','Document and workflow automation|Extract, categorise and route information through defined business processes.','Connected AI agents|Link tools with limited permissions, logging and explicit approval for sensitive actions.'],['One clearly defined workflow and success measure','Data sources, permissions and provider terms','Human review and escalation requirements','Evaluation, usage budget and monitoring'], [('Can an agent act on our systems?','Actions can be enabled within an explicitly authorised scope. Sensitive actions need appropriate approval and audit records.'),('Will AI always answer correctly?','No. We design evaluation, fallback and human review around the use case, rather than promising error-free outputs.'),('How are ongoing costs handled?','Model usage, hosting, integration services and support are scoped separately where appropriate, with agreed limits and monitoring.')])}
