page('about.html','About HeyDock','HeyDock provides IT services, software and AI automation.',hero('ABOUT HEYDOCK','A friendly hello.<br><em>A serious delivery partner.</em>','HeyDock brings IT support, technical talent, business software and AI automation together under one approachable brand.')+section('OUR COMPANY','Technology services.<br>Built around the work.','HeyDock delivers IT services for businesses and IT providers. Our business brings together project delivery experience and engineers in the UK and Europe.','<div class="editorial"><p>We serve both IT companies and direct business customers. That means adapting to the way you work—whether you need someone on site, additional remote expertise or a complete software implementation.</p><p>Our aim is simple: understand the requirement, agree a clear scope and make delivery visible. We grow our service offering around available expertise and the outcomes our customers need.</p></div>')+section('WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT','Clarity at every stage.','',steps([('Practical scope','Work and responsibilities agreed before delivery.'),('Suitable expertise','Capabilities matched to the actual task.'),('Visible progress','Updates, escalation and changes documented.'),('Useful handover','A result your team can operate and support.')]),'pale'),'/about.html')
