guides=[('plan-an-it-rollout','Plan an IT rollout','A practical checklist for devices, sites, access and handover.',['List each site, device count and deployment window.','Record the current environment and approved target configuration.','Confirm equipment, software licences and access prerequisites.','Assign the site contact, technical escalation and change approver.','Pilot the process before repeating it across locations.','Define testing, rollback, asset records and sign-off.']),('choose-business-software','Choose business software','Questions to ask before selecting or replacing a platform.',['Write down the business process and the problem to solve.','Separate essential requirements from preferences.','Confirm users, roles, integrations and data exports.','Compare licence, implementation, hosting and support costs.','Test with representative users and approved sample data.','Agree migration, training, acceptance and exit arrangements.']),('scope-an-ai-pilot','Scope an AI pilot','Start with a bounded workflow and measurable results.',['Choose one task with a named business owner.','Measure the current process so improvement can be assessed.','Identify permitted data and restricted information.','Define tools, permissions, human review and fallback.','Test normal cases, errors and inappropriate requests.','Set usage limits, monitoring and a production go/no-go review.'])]
